{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "16e1e14dd4c6a385d67fe6bb65e7b5b34614a1d9de1d5095be29f5515cde622b", "ja": "（もうすぐ、アイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』\nの撮影時間だ。さて、ロコの様子はどうかな……？）", "zh": "（再过不久就是偶像写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄时间了。话说，ROCO现在怎么样了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "9356eac252b8eb21e85015556aa6d5f4887bde551a4d82457ff9f7b65354dd6a", "ja": "{$P$}！\nインポータントなクエスチョンですー！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n有一个重要（Important）的问题（Question）要问你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b832353b37d653b293035a3813586a6364c507ee9742cee5538a222aaa3d6acb", "ja": "わっ、ロコ！　急に出てきたら、\nビックリするじゃないか。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "哇，ROCO！突然冒出来的话，会吓我一跳的。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "1b55d9e7543c7bdf9cbbebee2c7e06fcff31c49aa6c1e4c465285ce383a54949", "ja": "今のロコは、ちゃんと、\n{$P$}ナイズされてますか？", "zh": "现在的ROCO，有好好变成{$P$}风格吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1004_p", "source_sha256": "85c76c7401de7bb3e9ea7e0c99d8744f8dd90d487b5cc6ba89fe9687232b85ff", "ja": "俺ナイズ？\nロコナイズじゃなくて？", "zh": "我定制的？不是由ROCO定制的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "b15a1f89202f0faa9d13dfe344b65334f9ecab4bb57a6201239572327df0c198", "ja": "はい！　この衣装は、{$P$}が、\nロコのためにセレクトしてくれたものですから。", "zh": "是的！这套服装是{$P$}为了ROCO特意挑选的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "9e95e362c0a46a510a08a15d4d468b4f02d0ff939dd2a630458c62292cbde8e1", "ja": "なので、今のロコは、{$P$}の\nクリエイトした、アートなんです！", "zh": "所以，现在的ROCO，就是{$P$}创作的艺术品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4703a4c98efca00f4acaff7e8ca763ffdb73c9bf66a3110cd3a22eb73a4de7a2", "ja": "ふむ。だから俺の意図を聞きたいってことか。", "zh": "嗯。所以，你是想听听我的意图，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "c569fbb91bdd21d7414961eab4f3e792747019c2c7e0e3c32100ceb357bdb021", "ja": "アグリーです！　{$P$}はいつも、\nロコを理解してくれますから……。", "zh": "我同意！因为{$P$}总是能理解ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "c956771ddcbd6b321d950bc93f17b4daa394f6d579003ec3462d9b006889b4e9", "ja": "だからロコも、{$P$}のセンスを、\nパーフェクトにトランスミットしたいんです！", "zh": "所以，ROCO也想把{$P$}的品味完美地传达出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "378e7d0c41bfb170dee56e350ac7cf3ed26c561c3fcd577cd645d2c1e3ab9a18", "ja": "ロコ……。\nそんな風に考えてくれていたのか。", "zh": "ROCO……原来你一直是这么想的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "9daf8358629158d8133c987a0ebeeea14552a065b3ea65e8bd97aa67a4770c8f", "ja": "それに、{$P$}は、\nラストまでロコの衣装を悩んでたって聞きました。", "zh": "而且，我听说{$P$}直到最后都还在为ROCO的服装发愁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "e7720eebc0a34fc8e30d5e919947522f9ae41d446e5a7167a612a696157ce141", "ja": "ならロコだって、{$P$}のパートナー\nとして、ギリギリまでブラッシュアップしたいです！", "zh": "这样的话，作为{$P$}的搭档，ROCO也想一直完善到最后一刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "80993f68b5e58df84e5e6b78905c7ff70228b71092da6ec4076075cbe5f1a683", "ja": "コンセンサスは大事です！　ロコはちゃんと、\n{$P$}ナイズされていますか？", "zh": "达成共识很重要！ROCO有好好进行\n{$P$}化吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_1014", "source_sha256": "888c40dfccb99bb606a24c9e900f45fb9aa1d9a6819551bb7c11ad1edd974500", "ja": "アグリーです！", "zh": "我同意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_2000_p", "source_sha256": "310d4c6e6b8a8a02b435d2919f86882da5284d0737b3d421d7993ea9bc7cf646", "ja": "ああ、完璧だ！\nまさにイメージした通りだよ！", "zh": "啊，完美！\n正是我想象中的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_2001_025roc", "source_sha256": "ab2284cc50b8df49d21bdb29c10c60fa4383a127463dc71f98d9200ad8d459e9", "ja": "本当ですか！？　えへへ……\n{$P$}、ベリーサンクスです♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……\n{$P$}，非常感谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_2002_025roc", "source_sha256": "dffc1cb186c30edea7a86389c3a408488bc09f3ea3ffd5134c4a5b58c5eec20a", "ja": "ほんとは、衣装がかわいくてちょっと\n不安だったんです。けど……もう大丈夫です！", "zh": "其实，我是因为服装太可爱了，有点不安。可是……现在已经没事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0213_2003_025roc", "source_sha256": "11a778762bfa5f7fdf7415cdb359e6640f43fbeb35ad477de2b35023a6f80a5a", "ja": "{$P$}のセンス、\nロコがワールドワイドにアピールしてきますね！", "zh": "{$P$}的品味，\n就由ROCO向全世界展现出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
